      "id": "PR_kwDOKIwiaM7JOvzS",
      "title": "chore: update OP Stack terminology across documentation",
      "author": "sbvegan",
      "number": 1998,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n- Updates navigation structure in `docs.json`: removes the `superchain/` section, moves content to `op-stack/` and consolidates pages\n- Removes or merges pages that were specific to the Superchain umbrella concept (superchain-explainer, revenue explainer, registry page)\n- Adds `op-stack/ecosystem/` section with the superchain-registry page and `op-stack/protocol/blockspace-charter.mdx`\n- Updates terminology across ~100 documentation files to use consistent OP Stack framing\n- Fixes broken internal links resulting from moved/removed pages\n- Adds redirects in `docs.json` for all removed and moved pages\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `mint broken-links` passes (one pre-existing broken link in `chain-operators/guides/features/blobs.mdx` unrelated to this change)\n- [x] All renamed/moved pages have redirects in `docs.json`\n- [x] Navigation structure in `docs.json` validated\n- [x] Product names preserved: Superchain Faucet, Superchain paymaster, Superchain Token List, Superchain Bridges UI, Superscan, Superchain Dev Console\n- [x] Technical identifiers preserved: SuperchainERC20, SuperchainTokenBridge, SuperchainETHBridge, SuperchainConfig, superchain-registry (repo), superchain-ops (repo), superchain_level, superchain_time\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
